{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0001-s001", "text": "Integration betyder att en människa vänjer sig vid sitt nya hemland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T062634201813+0000-1/hb-c12-u0001-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.358367919921875, "generation_seconds": 22.26047956896946, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0001-s002", "text": "Hen lär sig språket och hittar ett arbete eller en studieplats och sin plats i samhället.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T062634201813+0000-1/hb-c12-u0001-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.346282958984375, "generation_seconds": 25.531481485115364, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0002-s001", "text": "Integration förutsätter att den nyanlända är aktiv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T062634201813+0000-1/hb-c12-u0002-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.330230712890625, "generation_seconds": 18.748222348978743, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0002-s002", "text": "Att till exempel lära sig språket och hitta arbete kräver mycket egen ansträngning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T062634201813+0000-1/hb-c12-u0002-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.4080810546875, "generation_seconds": 21.207607141928747, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0002-s003", "text": "En person som integrerat sig i Finland känner sig som en del av det finländska samhället och bidrar till att forma det på sätt som passar hen själv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T062634201813+0000-1/hb-c12-u0002-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.60843537414966, "peak": 0.269317626953125, "generation_seconds": 34.70572508499026, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0003-s001", "text": "I takt med att tiden i det nya landet går vänjer sig personen vid de nya sederna och börjar förstå dem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T062634201813+0000-1/hb-c12-u0003-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.3468017578125, "generation_seconds": 25.04960503592156, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0003-s002", "text": "Efter det är det lättare att leva i den nya miljön.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T062634201813+0000-1/hb-c12-u0003-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.326690673828125, "generation_seconds": 16.924937321105972, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c12-u0003-s003", "text": "Till slut är det möjligt att hitta en balans mellan de båda kulturerna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c12-integration/narration/resume-20261103T062634201813+0000-1/hb-c12-u0003-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.30987548828125, "generation_seconds": 19.48820985085331, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
